<title>USA: Oklahoma Water Board repriced, top yield unchanged.</title>
<headline>Oklahoma Water Board repriced, top yield unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc. said Tuesday it repriced Oklahoma Water Resources Board's $3.07 million bond deal, lowering yields in several maturities while leaving the top yield unchanged at 5.40 pct in 2015.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>OKLAHOMA WATER RESOURCES BOARD</p>
<p>RE: $3,070,000*</p>
<p>STATE LOAN PROGRAM REVENUE BONDS,</p>
<p>SERIES 1995 (CONVERTED SERIES 1997A)</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES</p>
<p>OF DTC</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE REPRICING.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>WILL ASSUME ALL ORDERS ARE GOOD AT ADJUSTED LEVELS UNLESS</p>
<p>CANCELLED BY 4:00PM TODAY.</p>
<p>					  REMARKETING</p>
<p>MOODY'S: NA		    S&amp;P: AA</p>
<p>DATED: 10/18/1995	    FIRST COUPON: 09/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 09/01</p>
<p>INTEREST ACCRUES: 04/29/1997</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>09/01/1997		   35M    3.60  %</p>
<p>09/01/1998		  110M    3.80  %</p>
<p>09/01/1999		  110M    4.00  %</p>
<p>09/01/2000		  115M    4.15  %</p>
<p>09/01/2001		  125M    4.30  %</p>
<p>09/01/2002		  130M    4.40  %</p>
<p>09/01/2003		  135M    4.50  %</p>
<p>09/01/2004		  140M    4.60  %</p>
<p>09/01/2005		  150M    4.70  %</p>
<p>09/01/2006		  155M    4.75  %</p>
<p>09/01/2011		  925M    5.25  %</p>
<p>09/01/2015		  940M    5.40  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 09/01/2006    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 09/01/2008</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Tuesday, April 22, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on April 29, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>The bonds will not be blue skyed in the following states: MN,</p>
<p>NV, NH AND WI.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Leo Oppenheim &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
